;exitX=0.816;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.447;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bld" target="run"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.92;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="mon" target="run"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="420" y="745"/><mxPoint x="420" y="380"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="gcl" target="src"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1230" y="585"/><mxPoint x="1230" y="540"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="src" target="bld"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="0" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1045" y="606"/><mxPoint x="557" y="606"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="12" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endSize=8;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#202124;labelBackgroundColor=#202124;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.842;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tf" target="z_gcp"><mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.35" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_t" value="&lt;b&gt;Chú thích mũi tên&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="870" width="300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_l" value="&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;  Camera AI → Cloud Run: HTTPS, X-Edge-Key, /api/edge/* (sự kiện, ảnh cắt đã làm mờ mặt, trạng thái bàn)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;  Chủ quán và nhân viên → Cloud Run: HTTPS, SSE (/api/stream), WebSocket (camera điện thoại)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Run đọc EDGE_KEY và khoá LLM từ Secret Manager thành biến môi trường&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Run đọc/ghi bucket qua gcsfuse tại /data&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Run gọi Gemini bằng khoá API: kiểm tra ảnh, tóm tắt ca, trợ lý ADK (nét đứt: kie.ai dự phòng, Vertex bước sau)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Build đẩy image lên Artifact Registry" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="900" width="780" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_r" value="&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Run kéo image khi tạo revision mới&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Build chạy gcloud run services update --image&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;  Uptime check gọi /api/health, lỗi thì Alert policy gửi email&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;  gcloud builds submit tải mã nguồn lên bucket tạm&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt;  Cloud Build đọc mã nguồn từ bucket tạm&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt;  terraform apply tạo mọi tài nguyên trong project" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="900" width="660" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_n" value="Nét liền: có trong mã hoặc IaC · Nét đứt: tùy chọn hoặc chưa làm · Không có: VPC, load balancer, Cloud Armor, Firestore, FCM, GPU. Icon Vertex AI là icon AI Platform (bộ draw.io chưa có icon Vertex AI); Terraform, kie.ai, Budget không có icon trong bộ." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5f6368;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1040" width="1480" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>